---
// EarlifyCTA.astro - Llamada a la acción final para centros y profesionales
---

<section class="cta-section section-padding" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-box glass-card">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2 id="cta-title" class="cta-title">
          ¿Listo para transformar la evaluación clínica y el neurodesarrollo en tu centro?
        </h2>
        <p class="cta-description">
          Da el primer paso hacia una evaluación auditivo-verbal estandarizada y asegura la continuidad terapéutica y pedagógica de tus pacientes y alumnos desde la consulta médica hasta la escuela y el hogar.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="btn-primary btn-large btn-cta-main" 
            onclick="document.getElementById('contact-modal')?.classList.add('open'); document.getElementById('contact-modal')?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');"
          >
            <span>Agendar Demo o Piloto Asistencial</span>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-decoration" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="glow-circle"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    padding: clamp(60px, 9vw, 110px) 0;
    position: relative;
    background-color: var(--bg-dark, #07090e);
  }

  .cta-box {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }

  .cta-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .cta-description {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--text-secondary, #cbd5e1);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn-cta-main {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1rem 2.2rem;
    min-height: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #4facfe 100%);
    color: #041017;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .btn-cta-main:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.6);
  }

  .cta-decoration {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .glow-circle {
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 600px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(80px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .btn-cta-main {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
